      "description": "B2B digital growth agency in Bhopal, India offering SEO, Google & Meta Ads, web development, WhatsApp and n8n AI automation, Generative Engine Optimization and white-label fulfilment for agencies.",
      "foundingDate": "2014-10-21",
      "identifier": {
        "@type": "PropertyValue",
